isConfigured: (account) => Boolean(account.token?.trim()),```So `configured` is true if `account.token` is truthy. And `account.token` comes from `resolveTelegramAccount` which calls `resolveTelegramToken`.

So if `configured: true`, then `account.token` was truthy. But `tokenSource: "none"` is also being reported, which is contradictory.

